Skills: PostgreSQL

Purpose:
  PostgreSQL skills organized by competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @L1-fundamentals.sdd
   3  @L2-advanced-queries.sdd
   4  @L3-performance-tuning.sdd
   5  @L4-enterprise-patterns.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn PostgreSQL fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply PostgreSQL patterns to schema
  REVIEW   — review PostgreSQL skills
  UPGRADE  — propose PostgreSQL skill upgrade

Rules:
  [P1]  Use appropriate data types.
  [P2]  Use constraints for data integrity.
  [P3]  Index frequently queried columns.
  [P4]  Avoid N+1 queries.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    L1-fundamentals.sdd

  Resolve:
    L1-fundamentals
    L2-advanced-queries
    L3-performance-tuning
    L4-enterprise-patterns

